red_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"suSDu8cXK_9uuAJopn2R1g","review_id":"6Os1m6m5kxZumbeXcYl6Cg","date":"2015-02-17T00:51:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9462953805923462,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Got off early from work and drove all the way to New Orleans East. The crawfish is phenomenal. Always hot and perfectly spiced. While there I purchased a pound of fresh large shrimps and redfish fillets to cook tomorrow. Since I was in full in gluttony mode, I also got a shrimp and oyster platter. The platter was amazing! I can go in for days about how much I love this place. It's always packed but it's for a reason. The staff is friendly and service is always quick. Remember the left side is broiled seafood and the right side is fried. Parking can be a pain despite the large availability of parking. I personally prefer potato salad with my platters. They also offer sodas..."},{"business_id":"suSDu8cXK_9uuAJopn2R1g","review_id":"QiWgOFWaSZqfRyC6CapXgw","date":"2014-06-01T22:14:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398288726806641,"text_excerpt":"I love this place my family has been going here since I was in elementary school and the food is always good. Pick anything in the menu and you will not be disappointed. They have the best crawfish in the city that's why they are always so packed any the po boy sandwiches are overstuffed. Yesterday I had my favorite po boy shrimp and oyster and it's as good as I remember. Don't mind the lines they move fast so you won't wait that long even though it looks like it. My top picks are shrimp poboy catfish poboy soft shell crab plate crawfish (of course) and the turkey necks."},{"business_id":"suSDu8cXK_9uuAJopn2R1g","review_id":"cVi7NnAGX7rcs2SRo1_YIA","date":"2012-08-09T14:16:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367168545722961,"text_excerpt":"This is my number one place to get crawfish. It is like a little market where you can order a variety of seafood. Everything looks so fresh! It is way better to order crawfish here since they are super cheap. We ordered several pounds (15?) of crawfish along with potatoes and corns. They were delicious, spicy, and consistent. The place is always packed so be prepared to wait for a while. I will always stop by here whenever I come to NOLA!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"suSDu8cXK_9uuAJopn2R1g","photo_id":"aV3nl6qhRR9ZNUhY65moOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aV3nl6qhRR9ZNUhY65moOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8904750347137451},{"business_id":"suSDu8cXK_9uuAJopn2R1g","photo_id":"WY1qhXmAyG7JWbPfyq_PXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WY1qhXmAyG7JWbPfyq_PXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8904748558998108}]},"notebook_case":null}
